# P1 round 2: the provider the session recorded has nothing to authenticate
# with at the resume. As provider-resume, then after the exit the profile is
# back on the Gateway **and** the switched-to provider cannot sign in: fx's
# Codex sign-in is deleted (`rmhome`), xfx's profile names no llmux url
# (`reseed`). fx stays on codex and says so once under the replay
# (restoreSessionCredential's `.missing`, app_auth_runtime.zig:172-182), and
# refuses the next prompt (missingPromptCredential, :198-214): no request.
fx: seed provider-carry-fx.json
xfx: seed provider-carry-xfx.json
fx: homefile .fx/chatgpt-auth.json provider-carry-chatgpt-auth.json
fx: env FX_E2E_OPENAI_CODEX_MODELS_URL=http://127.0.0.1:@PORT@/codex/models FX_E2E_OPENAI_CODEX_RESPONSES_URL=http://127.0.0.1:@PORT@/codex/responses
nomodel
gateway provider-carry-turns.json
work provider-carry-ws
wait 6
type read the notes and tell me what they say
key Enter
wait 15
type /provider
key Enter
wait 4
key Down
wait 1
key Enter
wait 10
type what day was it again?
key Enter
wait 15
snap turn2
keep
type /quit
key Enter
wait 4
fx: reseed provider-carry-fx.json
fx: rmhome .fx/chatgpt-auth.json
xfx: reseed provider-resume-missing-xfx.json
home reseeded
fx: relaunch --resume-last
xfx: relaunch --resume last
wait 10
snap resumed
type and after the resume?
key Enter
wait 10
snap refused
home end
gwlog
type /quit
key Enter
wait 3
